  data: {
    LLM: "Keep track of the 'King of Hearts' (The Kingen). In the Kingen round, dumping this card on an opponent is the single most important tactical move.\n\nStrategic Leading: If you have a weak hand, lead suits where you have middle-rank cards (7, 8, 9) to force opponents to win tricks with their 10s and face cards.\n\nVoid Management: Purposely exhaust your shortest suit early. This allows you to 'slough' (discard) your penalty cards (Queens/Hearts) safely onto tricks won by others.",
    Player: "Keep track of the 'King of Hearts' (The Kingen). In the Kingen round, dumping this card on an opponent is the single most important tactical move.\n\nStrategic Leading: If you have a weak hand, lead suits where you have middle-rank cards (7, 8, 9) to force opponents to win tricks with their 10s and face cards.\n\nVoid Management: Purposely exhaust your shortest suit early. This allows you to 'slough' (discard) your penalty cards (Queens/Hearts) safely onto tricks won by others.",
